   "commit": "e42ff29",
   "reason": "As in np-childs-format: np-main-n9/-n11 were run at e42ff29 with one uncommitted change (pfseeds.load_runs signature, not imported by pfcompare); spot-checked 2026-11-08 (np-childs-format/fit-change-checks.md). Used here only to check the affine per-step CNOT model."
  }
 },
